{"version":1,"key":"article:57","content":{"id":57,"title":"TypeScript 字面量类型及小技巧","author":"","content":[{"children":[{"text":"字面量类型。当通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"const","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 声明变量时，类型会被收缩为字面量类型","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"130157a4-dcf0-4068-a568-a50a2d897120","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const a = \"Hello\";","collabId":"439b3059-00f7-4d6c-bead-b1631a5f164c","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"2f18ddcb-14ad-465f-8324-3cdacbed7e99","language":"ts","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"335a0dad-c45f-47a8-b9c7-eeb1164e2672"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cc9e8b4c-2742-4658-b09b-fc58a3830526","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1e73fedc-1bad-4907-8cf8-77d0a1f6baf2.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1e73fedc-1bad-4907-8cf8-77d0a1f6baf2.png","width":577.9291432990478},{"children":[{"text":"当使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"let","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 声明类型时，不会收缩为字面量类型，也比较合理，毕竟声明为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"let","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 就表示可以继续被赋值，收缩为字面量没有意义。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0c7a22f5-3b7a-444a-9d72-c465100ee5c5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"let a = \"Hello\";","collabId":"f65b78c3-ca3e-41c0-8a79-acc908918bfa","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"631216c0-fdac-4041-b69e-4ff01e5c49da","language":"ts","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"4b6d5722-918b-454f-bba9-db17576e14c8"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5b60734b-390f-4b9b-a2b3-66e9b674a6fd","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bfbaf0e4-6c7a-400e-80b5-e491612e3b1e.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bfbaf0e4-6c7a-400e-80b5-e491612e3b1e.png","width":555.0408603961152},{"children":[{"text":"当使用字面量作为对象某字段的初始值，该字段不会被收缩为字面量，无论对象使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"let","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 还是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"const","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 声明，这也是合理的，只是对象不能被重新赋值，但是对象的属性是可以被重新赋值的","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6467c60f-11c8-4ff0-9022-81c07f82948e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const obj = {\n  a: \"Hello\",\n}\nobj.a = \"World\";","collabId":"ef63ce14-b6a3-4e8e-ad7c-612d1207354e","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"45349c3a-6e59-4a1b-b2dc-90b540ac7dc4","language":"ts","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"2de4d589-0860-446e-9202-e6dee0040851"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"70b2da3a-194e-4b91-bdf2-15486df64dea","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_50645cf2-d1eb-47f2-ac61-d058ae1cf8cf.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.